projects.introduction:
The **Nebraska Game and Parks Commission (NGPC)** is conducting a camera trap study on public and private lands in an effort to capture photos of the rare Plains Spotted Skunk (*Spilogale interrupta*). We need your help tagging trail camera photos in order to identify spotted skunks and other notable species that are present in Nebraska. 

----------
&nbsp;
In 2025, there have been two confirmed sightings in North-central Nebraska. Previous to this, the last sighting of a plains spotted skunk Nebraska was 2017. We hope that this camera trap effort will lead to more confirmed observations of this elusive creature in Nebraska. 

